That you don't see any magical portals is (partly) your own fault.
There is one, and it is on exactly the same spot where you first
arrived on Home 1. Try to remember where you arrived on this level. If
I'm correct, it should be in the bottom right corner, reachable by a
non-icy path (hope you have a different symbol for "Ice" and "Dungeon
Floor").

Oh, you cannot find it by any other means than standing next to it and
searching or stepping on it. When you originally arrived on Home 1, you
should have taken one step and then either searched or stepped back
onto the same spot, so that the portal would be revealed as a "^".

